==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Phantom Forces|Fearow|79}} from the {{TCG|Phantom Forces}} expansion.
*'''Peck Bugs''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Spearow|97}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Sun}}.

